# .env.example
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Creator Check-in does not currently use any environment
# variables. The app is a single-page static HTML/JS bundle
# with no backend, no database, and no third-party API keys.
#
# This file is provided per Developer-03 deliverable requirements
# (course final project) as a placeholder. If a backend is added
# in a future sprint, real variables will be documented here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Example for future use (commented out, not active):
# DATABASE_URL=
# API_BASE_URL=